;},{&quot;size&quot;:0,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;classroom&quot;},{&quot;size&quot;:0,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;game&quot;},{&quot;size&quot;:0,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;lab&quot;},{&quot;size&quot;:61,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;lesson&quot;},{&quot;size&quot;:0,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;path&quot;}]'></ql-pill-chart>\n<ql-button href='/profile/activity' label='View progress' text></ql-button>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<div class='your-progress-section__awards'>\n<div class='your-progress-section__badge-label-count'>\n<ql-speciality-chip specialityType='skill_badge'></ql-speciality-chip>\n<div class='badge-count'>3</div>\n</div>\n<ql-button href='/profile/badges' label='View badges' text></ql-button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class='dashboard__section leaderboard__section'>\n</div>\n\n<nk-weekly-activity class='activity-section'></nk-weekly-activity>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</main>\n\n</ql-drawer-content>\n<footer slot='drawer-content'>\n<nav ariaLabel='Footer navigation' class='application-footer relaunch-extra'>\n\n<div class='footer-container'>\n<div class='footer-logo'>\n<a class=\"custom-logo\" aria-label=\"Google Skills\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"custom-logo\"><img alt=\"Google Skills\" height=\"24\" aria-label=\"Google Skills\" src=\"https://cdn.qwiklabs.com/lqJbxogu4tSLez1OvjDcIO8rwow6cPLwvrfIdmQLf6U%3D\" /></div></a>\n</div>\n<div class='footer-row'>\n<a href=\"/\">Dashboard</a>\n<a href=\"/catalog\">Catalog</a>\n<a href=\"/paths\">Paths</a>\n<a href=\"/subscriptions\">Subscriptions</a>\n<a href=\"/profile/stay_on_track\">Activities</a>\n<a href=\"/profile/badges\">Achievements</a>\n<a href=\"/my_account/profile\">Settings</a>\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" data-method=\"delete\" href=\"/users/sign_out\">Sign out</a>\n</div>\n<div class='footer-row'>\n<a class=\"g-cloud-youtube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@googlecloud\"><ql-icon icon='video_youtube'></ql-icon>\nYoutube\n</a><a rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"hallofmirrors.helpService.startHelp({&quot;productData&quot;:{&quot;userId&quot;:85622705},&quot;context&quot;:&quot;&quot;}); return false;\" href=\"/help\">Help Center</a>\n<a href=\"/terms_of_service\">Terms</a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/privacy_policy\">Privacy</a>\n<a aria-hidden='true' class='glue-cookie-notification-bar-control'>\nManage cookies\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</nav>\n</footer>\n</ql-drawer-container>\n\n<span class='hidden' id='flash-sibling-before'></span>\n<ql-snackbar></ql-snackbar>\n\n<script data-glue-cookie-notification-bar-category='2A' src='https://www.gstatic.com/glue/cookienotificationbar/cookienotificationbar.min.js'></script>\n\n\n\n<ql-dialog id='js-barker-help-dialog' style='--dialog-width:800px;'>\n<h1 class='ql-headline-large'>Frequently asked questions</h1>\n<div class='barker-help-content'>\n<ql-collapsible>\n<div class='ql-title-medium' slot='header'>How do I earn points?</div>\n<div class='ql-body-large' slot='collapsible'>\n<p>Points can be earned by doing a variety of activities that contribute to your learning. Such activities include taking a lab, passing a quiz, watching a video, completing a course, and more!</p>\n</div>\n</ql-collapsible>\n<ql-collapsible>\n<div class='ql-title-medium' slot='header'>What are leagues?</div>\n<div class='ql-body-large' slot='collapsible'>\n<p>Leagues are used to group learners into different tiers. There are currently four leagues: Bronze, Silver, Gold, and Diamond. All learners begin in the Bronze League. Climbing to higher leagues will take commitment, hard work, and determination!</p>\n</div>\n</ql-collapsible>\n<ql-collapsible>\n<div class='ql-title-medium' slot='header'>How do leaderboards work?</div>\n<div class='ql-body-large' slot='collapsible'>\n<p>After earning some points, you will be placed into a new leaderboard with 29 other learners from your league, where you will compete to earn the most points. Leaderboards last for a week, starting from when they are first created. At the end of the week, the top 10 learners will earn a promotion to the next-highest league (if one exists), and the bottom 5 learners will be demoted down to the next-lowest league (if one exists). Only the points you earn during each week count towards that week’s leaderboard, with all learners starting at zero points when the leaderboard is first created.</p>\n</div>\n</ql-collapsible>\n<ql-collapsible>\n<div class='ql-title-medium' slot='header'>What happens if I take a break from learning?</div>\n<div class='ql-body-large' slot='collapsible'>\n<p>After your current leaderboard finishes, you will not be placed into a new leaderboard until you earn points again. So if you take a break from learning and therefore earn no points for a long period of time, you don’t have to worry about being demoted during that time. Your league progress is safe!</p>\n</div>\n</ql-collapsible>\n<ql-collapsible>\n<div class='ql-title-medium' slot='header'>Is there a possibility that I could lose my points and league progress?</div>\n<div class='ql-body-large' slot='collapsible'>\n<p>This is an experimental feature, and so a hard reset of all learners’ leagues, points, and leaderboards may happen at any time during the experiment. These resets would only apply to points, leaderboards, and leagues - not any of your other data on the platform.</p>\n</div>\n</ql-collapsible>\n<ql-collapsible>\n<div class='ql-title-medium' slot='header'>How do other learners see me on their leaderboards?</div>\n<div class='ql-body-large' slot='collapsible'>\n<p>Other learners will see your selected avatar and an anonymized username on their leaderboards. They will not see your profile picture, nor your real name.</p>\n</div>\n</ql-collapsible>\n<ql-collapsible>\n<div class='ql-title-medium' slot='header'>How does my player name work?</div>\n<div class='ql-body-large' slot='collapsible'>\n<p>Your player name is generated randomly as a positive adjective followed by an animal in English, e.g. “Glorious Koala”. You cannot change your player name. Your player name is chosen once for each leaderboard. You will get a new player name for each leaderboard you participate in.</p>\n</div>\n</ql-collapsible>\n<ql-collapsible>\n<div class='ql-title-medium' slot='header'>Can I opt-out of this?</div>\n<div class='ql-body-large' slot='collapsible'>\n<p>Yes, you can opt-out of these features through your <a href=\"/my_account/profile\">General account settings</a>, and can freely opt back in at any time.</p>\n</div>\n</ql-collapsible>\n</div>\n</ql-dialog>\n\n\n\n<script>\n  document.addEventListener(\"turbo:load\", function () {\n    ql.initMaterialInputs();\n    initChosen();\n    initTabs();\n    ql.list.init();\n    ql.favoriting.init();\n    ql.header.myAccount.init();\n    initTooltips();\n    ql.autocomplete.init();\n    ql.modals.init();\n    ql.toggleButtons.init();\n    Turbo.session.drive = false;\n    ql.searchHeader.init({isRelaunch: true});\n  (new ql.searchAutocomplete()).init({forHeaderNew: true, topSuggestions: [{\"label\":\"machine learning\"},{\"label\":\"cloud architecture\"},{\"label\":\"generative ai\"},{\"label\":\"data analyst\"},{\"label\":\"security fundamentals\"}]});\n  ql.chat.init();\n  ql.chat.init();\n  ql.messages.init();\n  ql.jumpContent.init();\n  \n  }, {once: true});\n</script>\n<script>\n  document.addEventListener(\"turbo:load\", () => ql.analytics.init(), {once: true});\n</script>\n<script>\n  document.addEventListener(\"turbo:load\", function () {\n    ql.celebrations.init({\"course_complete\":\"COURSE COMPLETED\",\"document_complete\":\"DOCUMENT COMPLETED\",\"experience_label\":\"Experience points\",\"lab_complete\":\"LAB COMPLETED\",\"learning_plan_complete\":\"PATH COMPLETED\",\"lesson_complete\":\"LESSON COMPLETED\",\"quiz_complete\":\"QUIZ COMPLETED\",\"video_complete\":\"VIDEO COMPLETED\"});\n    ql.achievements.init();\n  }, {once: true});\n</script>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n\n\n"
